## Provenance

- **Project origin.** Pocket Oracle grows out of
  [Tarot Rider-Waite](https://github.com/jrpasolini/Tarot-Rider-Waite), an
  earlier interactive Portuguese-language grimoire by the same author. The draw
  flow and the overall concept started there; this repository is a new build
  begun on 2026-10-15. The origin project is credited in the README ("Origin and
  credit"). Because both projects share the same author, that reuse does not
  introduce third-party rights.
- **Card images.** The Rider-Waite card images are in the **public domain**,
  obtained from a collection based on the
  [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/) archive. They are not
  covered by the MIT licence above — they are already free of copyright.
- **Third-party services.** The app calls Cloudflare Workers AI (open-weight
  models) and, optionally, ElevenLabs for narration. Those services are governed
  by their own terms; no third-party code or data is vendored into this
  repository.

